==Battleground==
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Akane Tendo (Enemy)|Akane Tendo]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**4 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

